672	     * red as its left child with the fixup loop not running (parent is the
673	     * root); "a" then inserts red as "b"'s left child, an outer grandchild
674	     * (a "line", not a triangle), forcing a single right-rotation at "c"
675	     * with no preceding rotation at "b". Mirrored by Case 10 below; together
